WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:01,960
a little later

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:12,430
This purple lotus can't protect her. Sister Yun waits until she wakes up.

3
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:16,110
Let her drink water and eat first. Don't let her get out of bed. I'll keep an eye on her.

4
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,240
You can't even sit still now. Save your life first.

5
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:47,350
I dare to know that there are still living people under the grave. That's all. Sister Yun leaves it to you.
